# DA1: DEEP-CONTEXT arm A of AB (A = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix, the production profile on the window image; B = DL1, the Lever N traffic profile). Eight real-code users at about 32,000 tokens and then at about
# 120,000 tokens each as the server counts them, started together, 800 out: the eight seats all live at depth, the shape the 262k window exists for (T9b of the 262k pack ran the same test names). TIMED: no audits, no digests.
# READ per arm: every user at budget, no error, no hang, SMOKE_CHECK clean; per pair the eight-live tok/s and the first-token time of the 120k round (the arm B / arm A ratio), the hashes of the A and B texts compared by hand
# (not exact by contract at depth: report only). ARC runners at zero. Estimate: attach 4, warmup 1, 8 x 32k about 4, 8 x 120k about 9 (prefill 960,000 tokens at the measured cold rate plus 800 decode tokens): 18; the box is 1.5 x 26.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the third session of 2026-10-08/09 (s0809) (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it). ORDER.txt has the order, the classes, the minutes, the boxes, the tags
# and every rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11 is the window image (the Lever N traffic profile baked in as its default); tp4-serve-10 is the production base image. C2_BOX_MINUTES is the job's box:
# the workflow enforces it from inside, it never cancels a run. NO profile of this pack carries a digest or an audit (QWEN_PREFIX_DIGESTS, QWEN_PREFIX_AUDIT, the lever audits): test_tp4_session_0809 pins that.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_code_32k,concurrent8_code_128k
C2_BOX_MINUTES=30
